            <ArticleTitle>Gall stone ileus with acute kidney injury--a case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>908-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.3109/0886022X.2011.605530</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Gall stone ileus is a rare serious complication of cholelithiasis. We report a case of cholecystoduodenal fistula presenting as gall stone ileus with acute kidney injury which was managed successfully.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
